# Birthday Parties at AeroSports Scarborough

AeroSports Scarborough offers three distinct birthday party packages: Premium, VIP, and Ultimate. Each package includes a minimum of ten jumpers and features amenities such as pizza, drinks, a private party room, a glow t-shirt, digital invitations, and a free sixty-minute add-on pass for guest jumpers.

[2] (source: birthday_parties.md)
## Add-Ons

Birthday party add-ons available at AeroSports Scarborough include large pizzas (cheese, pepperoni, halal pepperoni, vegetarian, or Hawaiian) for twenty-five dollars each. Juice boxes are available in packs of ten for thirty dollars. Soft drink cans come in packs of ten for twenty dollars. Physical birthday invitations cost seventy-five cents each. An outside food fee is fifty dollars but is waived for the Ultimate Party. A go-kart race add-on costs nine dollars and ninety cents per person, already included in the Ultimate Party. A late ordering fee within twenty-four hours is twenty dollars.

[3] (source: chatbot_quick_replies.md)
### Party Info

**Sample question:** Tell me about birthday parties?

**Response:** AeroSports Scarborough offers three different birthday party packages. Each package starts at thirty-nine dollars and ninety cents per participant, with a minimum requirement of ten children. All packages include pizza, drinks, access to a private party room, a glow t-shirt for the birthday child, and digital invitations. The Ultimate Package additionally includes go-karting, a free thirty-day pass, and complimentary socks for all attendees. Would you like more details on a specific package?

[4] (source: birthday_parties.md)
## Package Comparisons

[5] (source: group_bookings.md)
## Corporate & Team Parties

AeroSports Scarborough offers corporate and team parties suitable for various occasions such as team-building events, milestone celebrations, and employee rewards. These gatherings take place in an energetic environment featuring trampoline courts, obstacle courses, and more. Customizable packages are available to cater to specific needs.

For booking a corporate event, interested parties can call 289-454-5555 or send an email to events.scb@aerosportsparks.ca for further assistance and package details.

[6] (source: voice_call_scripts.md)
## Birthday Party Packages Overview

Pause between each package description to ensure clarity: "We have three birthday party packages available. The Premium Party starts at thirty-nine dollars and ninety cents per jumper with seventy-five minutes of jump time and forty-five minutes in a private party room. The VIP Party is priced at forty-four dollars and ninety cents per jumper, offering ninety minutes of jump time and sixty minutes of room time. Lastly, the Ultimate Party costs fifty-nine dollars and ninety cents per jumper, which includes one hundred and twenty minutes of jump time, sixty minutes of room time, plus go-karting for every participant. All packages come with pizza and drinks included, requiring a minimum of ten jumpers."

[7] (source: birthday_parties.md)
## Terms & Conditions

Birthday party terms and conditions at AeroSports Scarborough include free rescheduling up to one year from the booking date. Cancellations with fourteen or more days' notice receive a store gift card for the refund amount, while cancellations within fourteen days result in no refund. Package changes must be made fourteen or more days in advance and are subject to availability. Waivers are required for all jumpers; those under eighteen must have their waivers signed by a parent or guardian and remain valid for one year. Room supplies such as plates, cups, and tablecloths are included. The jumping area is shared with other patrons, but the party room is private. Prohibited items include piñatas, confetti, and silly string, which incur a forty-dollar cleaning charge if used. Guests should advise of any food allergies or sensitivities in advance. All guests should arrive twenty minutes early for check-in. AeroSports Scarborough is not responsible for lost or stolen items.


